WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.555 --> 00:00:03.555
(soft piano music)

00:00:04.936 --> 00:00:08.678
♪ He'd take the world off my shoulders ♪

00:00:08.678 --> 00:00:13.252
♪ If it was ever hard to move ♪

00:00:13.252 --> 00:00:17.158
♪ He'd turn the rain to a rainbow ♪

00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:21.623
♪ When I was living in the blue ♪

00:00:21.623 --> 00:00:25.513
♪ Why then, if he is so perfect ♪

00:00:25.513 --> 00:00:30.038
♪ Do I still wish that it was you ♪

00:00:30.038 --> 00:00:33.455
♪ Perfect don't mean that it's working ♪

00:00:33.455 --> 00:00:38.147
♪ So what can I do ♪

00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:42.795
♪ When you're out of sight ♪

00:00:42.795 --> 00:00:47.021
♪ In my mind ♪

00:00:47.021 --> 00:00:50.292
♪ 'Cause sometimes I look in his eyes ♪

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:55.253
♪ And that's where I
find a glimpse of us ♪

00:00:55.253 --> 00:00:58.658
♪ And I try to fall for his touch ♪

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:03.118
♪ But I'm thinking of the way it was ♪

00:01:03.118 --> 00:01:06.049
♪ Hoping I'll find ♪

00:01:06.049 --> 00:01:08.882
♪ A glimpse of us ♪

00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:16.051
(soft piano music continues)

00:01:16.051 --> 00:01:19.620
♪ 'Cause sometimes I look in his eyes ♪

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:24.620
♪ And that's where I
find a glimpse of us ♪

00:01:24.629 --> 00:01:28.091
♪ And I try to fall for his touch ♪

00:01:28.091 --> 00:01:32.978
♪ But I'm thinking of the way it was ♪

00:01:32.978 --> 00:01:37.025
♪ Said I'm fine and said I moved on ♪

00:01:37.025 --> 00:01:41.042
♪ I'm only here passing time in his arms ♪

00:01:41.042 --> 00:01:44.932
♪ Hoping I'll find ♪

00:01:44.932 --> 00:01:47.765
♪ A glimpse of us ♪

00:01:53.674 --> 00:01:56.612
(audience cheering and applauding)

